          <div class="faq__a" id="fa2" role="region" aria-labelledby="fq2"><div>
            <p>No to both. Estimates are free and a midnight call costs the same as a Tuesday
            morning one. If you decide not to go ahead after we look at the door, you owe
            nothing.</p>
          </div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__i">
          <button class="faq__q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fa3" id="fq3">
            What does a spring job actually cost?
            <span class="faq__s" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq__a" id="fa3" role="region" aria-labelledby="fq3"><div>
            <p>Springs start at $175 each plus $99 labour, so a typical pair lands around $449.
            Door size and the spring cycle rating move the final number. If you are comparing
            us against another shop, ask whether their price covers both springs and the
            labour. That is usually where the gap is.</p>
          </div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__i">
          <button class="faq__q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fa4" id="fq4">
            Why do both springs get replaced when only one broke?
            <span class="faq__s" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq__a" id="fa4" role="region" aria-labelledby="fq4"><div>
            <p>The pair wears at the same rate, so the second one is usually close behind.
            Replacing one leaves the door unbalanced and brings you a second service call
            within months. You can ask for a single spring and we will do it, but we will
            tell you what to expect.</p>
          </div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__i">
          <button class="faq__q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fa5" id="fq5">
            What does the warranty cover?
            <span class="faq__s" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq__a" id="fa5" role="region" aria-labelledby="fq5"><div>
            <p>Five years on every spring we install, parts and the labour to swap it. Openers
            and other hardware carry the manufacturer warranty, which we register in your name
            at the install so you are not chasing paperwork later. You get the terms in writing
            at the visit.</p>
          </div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__i">
          <button class="faq__q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fa6" id="fq6">
